 reference of the ",{"c":"runic-views"}," catalog, which the page shows in the window's language; ",{"c":"null"}," for an attribute it has no text for, or one with a message of its own."],"remarks":[{"p":["It covers ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.RequiredAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.MaxLengthAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.MinLengthAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.StringLengthAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.LengthAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.RangeAttribute"}," (inclusive limits), ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.EmailAddressAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.PhoneAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.UrlAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.CreditCardAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.RegularExpressionAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.CompareAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.FileExtensionsAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.Base64StringAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.AllowedValuesAttribute"},", ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.DeniedValuesAttribute"}," and ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.EnumDataTypeAttribute"},"; types derived from them keep their message, as do attributes that set ",{"see":"P:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.ValidationAttribute.ErrorMessage"}," or a message resource, and a ",{"see":"T:System.ComponentModel.DataAnnotations.RangeAttribute"}," with an exclusive limit."]}," ",{"p":["The field's name is ",{"see":"P:Runic.Application.Views.RunicValidationMember.DisplayName"},", as the attribute's message writes it. To combine it with the application's own texts, call it last: ",{"c":"TextFor = (attribute, member) => AppText(attribute, member) ?? RunicViewsTranslations.ValidationText(attribute, member)"},". The page resolves the reference with this catalog (",{"c":"@runic-artifex/views-translations"},"); a page without it shows the reference's English fallback."]}],"exceptions":[{"cref":"T:System.ArgumentNullException","doc":["An argument is ",{"c":"null"},"."]}]}}]}]}
